<title>PHILIPPINES: La Tondena 9-mth net up 50.96 pct.</title>
<headline>La Tondena 9-mth net up 50.96 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net Sales (billion)	    5.31 vs 4.02</p>
<p>    Net income			 581.463 vs 385.165</p>
<p>Note: Liquor maker La Tondena Distillers Inc is a unit of San Miguel Corp.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
